flowchart TD
  MIC["Microphone / host field A"] --> TOKEN["request token + field epoch + fingerprint"]
  TOKEN --> AUDIO["SpeechRecognitionService ASR + optional voice translation"]
  AUDIO --> OUT["TranscriptionBridge outbox: resultID/token/epoch"]
  OUT --> CLAIM{"Can prove originating field?"}
  CLAIM -->|document UUID + fingerprint| LIVE{"Live partial already inserted?"}
  CLAIM -->|documentless F-0018: same process only| FIELD["Possible unrelated field B"]
  CLAIM -->|no| KEEP["Keep pending + History; no automatic insert"]
  LIVE -->|yes| RECON["LiveFinalReconciliation: append/replace/review"]
  LIVE -->|no| AUTO{"Default LLM action enabled?"}
  RECON -->|uncertain| KEEP
  RECON -->|safe| UIKit["UIKit host insertion"]
  AUTO -->|no| UIKit
  AUTO -->|yes| ACKFIRST["F-0022 acknowledge original BEFORE LLM completion"]
  ACKFIRST --> LLMREQ["LLMBridge single request slot"]
  LLMREQ --> HOSTLLM["Offline model, request-scoped result/status"]
  HOSTLLM --> LLMRESULT["Result file, requestID"]
  LLMRESULT --> MATCH{"Original selection/document/context?"}
  MATCH -->|yes| UIKit
  MATCH -->|no F-0021| CLIP["Global clipboard overwritten"]
  LLMRESULT -.->|F-0023 old keyboard owner gone| BLOCK["Orphan result blocks new jobs"]
  UIKit --> ACK["Outbox remove acknowledgment"]
  UIKit -.->|F-0025 crash before ack| REPLAY["Possible final duplicate on reentry"]
  TOKEN --> PART["Live Qwen partial token/revision"]
  PART --> LV["Keyboard live owner/anchor"]
  LV --> UIKit
  LV -.->|F-0019 recreated controller loses revision| REPLAY
  UIKit --> HISTORY["LLM string history (no document owner)"]
  HISTORY --> UNDO["Undo/Redo context equality only"]
  UNDO -.->|F-0020 same text different field| FIELD
  OUT -.->|F-0024 unscoped newest only| KEEP
  AUDIO -.->|F-0026 short wrong-language accepted| OUT
